# Puca's Eye: "Activate only if there are five colors among permanents you control" (CR 105.2): only Bot1's own permanents
# count. Bot1 controls Omnath (red, green, white, blue) and names red for the Eye, so it has four colors; Bot2 controls a
# black Dark Confidant, which makes five in all but not five among Bot1's, so the draw is refused even with {G}{W}{U} in the pool.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Omnath, Locus of Creation
Puca's Eye
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Dark Confidant
Island x17

